#   - masonry or other techs which give a lot of buildings is valued less
#   - techs that give a better civic can be valued higher (capped at 2400 instead of 1200)
#   - techs that reveal bonus resources are weighted by how frequent that bonus occurs
# Changed paths (1):
#   M /trunk/CvGameCoreDLL/CvPlayerAI.cpp

